Package: oovault
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: SECRET STORE
 Encrypted secret vault storing API keys and tokens backed by kernel keyrings.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
